@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PEGA_AQUI_TU_TOKEN_DE_ACCESO

### SERIALIZED-UNITS - solicitudes HTTP
# Reemplaza el token y ajusta los cuerpos JSON al modelo de la entidad.

### GET /serialized-units
GET {{baseUrl}}/serialized-units
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### GET /serialized-units/1
GET {{baseUrl}}/serialized-units/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

###

### POST /serialized-units
POST {{baseUrl}}/serialized-units
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "serial": "SERIAL-DEMO-001",
  "secondarySerial": null,
  "state": "IN_STOCK",
  "receivedAt": "2026-10-14T10:00:00.000Z"
}

###

